<title>USA: Texas Instruments names new Japan president.</title>
<headline>Texas Instruments names new Japan president.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Texas Instruments Inc said Tuesday Toshiaki Ikoma will become president of its TI Japan Ltd affiliate.</p>
<p>Ikoma, who is head of TI Japan's Tsukuba Research and Development Center, will succeed Sachiaki Nagae, who is retiring effective January 31.</p>
</text>
